    "The @foldkit/ui ratchet (plans/14-ui-v1.md, 'Keeping it true'; Scribe #2594).",
    "The owner decided on 2026-11-20 that every @foldkit/ui widget moves to a core part, one at a time, starting now, and that the widgets keep working while they do. So each count below is expected to fall with each widget moved, and may not rise.",
    "Counted per file: imports of foldkit/html, foldkit/dom, foldkit/mount, foldkit/render, foldkit/file and @floating-ui/dom (and Html, Mount, Dom, Render, File taken from the foldkit root), each use of what those imports gave, and each mention of document and window.",
    "A file not listed here counts zero.",
    "`pnpm check:painter-ratchet`, which `pnpm lint` runs, fails when the code holds more than this file says. A widget's rule goes in packages/foldkit/src/behavior/, not in a new view.",
